{"id":"b8dcaf1e9983890627a2b3edde02c2c33547df88","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1230570","title":"Open code go 是量化版本吗？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"VonemSnake","excerpt":"OpenAI - @VonemSnake - 最近用 go 套餐里面 Deep seek v4 flash ，感觉又慢又笨，json 都能经常写坏，换回官方 API ，瞬间舒畅了。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>最近用 go 套餐里面 Deep seek v4 flash ，感觉又慢又笨，json 都能经常写坏，换回官方 API ，瞬间舒畅了。</p></div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/代码\"><li></li> 代码</a><a href=\"/tag/量化\"><li></li> 量化</a><a href=\"/tag/API\"><li></li> API</a></P><p><span>15 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-07-29 22:48:30 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914455\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7bad/8a20/441003_normal.png?m=1716075803\" alt=\"ebushicao\" data-uid=\"441003\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ebushicao\">ebushicao</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 07:49:10 +08:00\">22h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是不是量化我不知道，但现在体验越来越差了，部分模型改成 15 刀限额不说，速度还奇慢，经常服务还会蹦，我之前还挺推崇的，昨天已经取消订阅了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914463\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/aeef/f75c/544259_normal.png?m=1711433926\" alt=\"Stunt4013\" data-uid=\"544259\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Stunt4013\">Stunt4013</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 08:00:31 +08:00\">22h 21m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>据之前 DeepSeek 宕机，OpenCode api 也挂掉的信息，似乎是用的官方 api ，但是最近确实感觉到越来越笨了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914517\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ba8ff9ce060a7036dc45361ca8e73411?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"VonemSnake\" data-uid=\"450729\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/VonemSnake\">VonemSnake</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 08:30:47 +08:00\">21h 51m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我做定制 agent ，一个任务官方 API 只需要 15 分钟，用 go 里面的，跑一个小时进度也就 60%</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914629\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7e19/69c8/77850_normal.png?m=1765716032\" alt=\"Rorysky\" data-uid=\"77850\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Rorysky\">Rorysky</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 08:59:05 +08:00\">21h 22m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 4</span>\n                    \n                    <p>不是的，是直接接的 ds 官方 api<br>所以说人的感觉和偏见很多</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914845\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/780f/3cc6/627042_normal.png?m=1774244060\" alt=\"yiranw09\" data-uid=\"627042\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yiranw09\">yiranw09</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 09:39:02 +08:00\">20h 42m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你怕不是用官方 api 灰测到正式版了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914861\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/11f587e817a8ccae2b58323bb2822f6a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"quan01994\" data-uid=\"440554\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/quan01994\">quan01994</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 09:40:53 +08:00\">20h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最近我感觉 deepseek api 变笨了好多。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914965\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/df4b/2536/207766_normal.png?m=1655280803\" alt=\"zmqiang\" data-uid=\"207766\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zmqiang\">zmqiang</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 09:55:33 +08:00\">20h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>你可以试着把 opencode go 的 api 接入到 copilot 中，你会发现又聪明了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17914994\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/1a77/befc/4768_normal.png?m=1752463987\" alt=\"levn\" data-uid=\"4768\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/levn\">levn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 09:58:21 +08:00\">20h 23m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>模型发布时已经是 FP8+FP4 量化的，284B 参数大小 160GB</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915129\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/8553/adf9/10426_normal.png?m=1688377906\" alt=\"tf2\" data-uid=\"10426\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>12</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/tf2\">tf2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 10:14:25 +08:00\">20h 7m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>智商下降说明孕晚期了下一代就快出来了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17915857\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6843f5b55702f07702f48e1e1ad35cf1?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"johnhuangemc2\" data-uid=\"100782\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>14</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/johnhuangemc2\">johnhuangemc2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-07-29 11:48:10 +08:00\">18h 33m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我也觉得 DeepSeek 最近降智了, 不管是 Opencode GO 的还是官网 API 的, 做事敷衍了很多.</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17918427\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n 